# Backend utils

Governor for `backend/src/utils`. Executor: `.cursor/skills/backend/backend-utils/SKILL.md`.

## Hard rules

- Utils are **backend-only** — do not add `@aixellabs/backend/utils` exports for the frontend.
- Default scrape I/O is TLS + Evomi (`node-tls-client-session-handler` + `PROXY_CONFIG`) — don’t invent a new browser stack without an existing module precedent.
- Shared location Zod lives in `location-schema.ts` — reuse it; don’t fork country/state/city schemas per module.
- Only promote helpers here when reused across modules; keep product-specific logic in `api/<module>/`.
- Do not revive `browser-worker` / `guerrilla-mail` without a live importer and docs.
